="v1" begin="00:25.910" end="00:32.780"><span begin="00:25.910" end="00:26.090">My </span><span begin="00:26.090" end="00:26.570">tongue </span><span begin="00:26.570" end="00:27.380">dances </span><span begin="00:27.380" end="00:28.040">behind </span><span begin="00:28.040" end="00:28.400">my </span><span begin="00:28.400" end="00:29.030">lips </span><span begin="00:29.030" end="00:29.240">for </span><span begin="00:29.240" end="00:32.780">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.630" end="00:38.990"><span begin="00:35.630" end="00:35.930">This </span><span begin="00:35.930" end="00:36.620">fire </span><span begin="00:36.620" end="00:37.340">rising </span><span begin="00:37.340" end="00:37.760">through </span><span begin="00:37.760" end="00:38.120">my </span><span begin="00:38.120" end="00:38.990">being</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.140" end="00:45.440"><span begin="00:39.140" end="00:39.920">Burning </span><span begin="00:39.920" end="00:40.280">I'm </span><span begin="00:40.280" end="00:40.670">not </span><span begin="00:40.670" end="00:41.120">used </span><span begin="00:41.120" end="00:41.360">to </span><span begin="00:41.360" end="00:42.440">seeing </span><span begin="00:42.440" end="00:45.440">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.230" end="00:53.210"><span begin="00:48.230" end="00:48.530">I'm </span><span begin="00:48.530" end="00:51.380">alive </span><span begin="00:51.380" end="00:51.770">I'm </span><span begin="00:51.770" end="00:53.210">alive</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.520" end="00:58.760"><span begin="00:55.520" end="00:55.970">I </span><span begin="00:55.970" end="00:56.360">can </span><span begin="00:56.360" end="00:56.840">feel </span><span begin="00:56.840" end="00:57.260">you </span><span begin="00:57.260" end="00:57.740">all </span><span begin="00:57.740" end="00:58.490">around </span><span begin="00:58.490" end="00:58.760">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.760" end="01:02.060"><span begin="00:58.760"